---
// User agreement and disclaimer, plus the Montana Mesonet data license.
// Text matches mco-website/_pages/about/about_agreement.md; the license
// wording comes from mt-climate-office/mesonet-license. Both Mesonet APIs and
// the dashboard's data MANIFEST link this address (redirects.json keeps it).
// The disclaimer applies to everything the office publishes, not only the
// Mesonet, and must not limit what the CC BY 4.0 license grants.
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/paths';
---
<Base short="User agreement"
      description="The Montana Mesonet data license (CC BY 4.0) and the Montana Climate Office user agreement and disclaimer for its data and services.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>User Agreement and Disclaimer</h1>
    <h2 id="mesonet-license">Montana Mesonet data license</h2>
    <p>
      Montana Mesonet data are licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.
      You may copy, share and adapt them for any purpose, including commercial use, if you credit
      the Montana Mesonet, link to the license, and say whether you changed the data.
    </p>
    <p>
      Credit: Montana Mesonet, Montana Climate Office. A service of the University of Montana. <a href={url('mesonet/') + '#mesonet-cite'}>How to cite the data</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      The license covers data measured at Montana Mesonet stations: observations, logger records,
      station photos, power, compliance and soil data. It does not cover the air quality data,
      which come from PurpleAir sensors and whose terms are still being reviewed. It does not
      cover software or other Montana Climate Office products.
    </p>
    <h2 id="disclaimer">Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      The Montana Climate Office (MCO) publishes its data and services in good faith as a public
      service. The MCO does not warrant their accuracy, adequacy, or completeness. Observations
      from automated sensors can contain errors, gaps, and delays, and they may be corrected,
      backfilled, or revised at any time. The MCO may change or discontinue its services at any
      time.
    </p>
    <p>
      MCO products were not produced for legal, engineering, or surveying purposes. Anyone relying
      on them for such purposes should consult the primary data and information sources to confirm
      they are suitable.
    </p>
    <p>
      To the extent permitted by law, the MCO is not liable for incorrect results or analysis, or
      for any direct, indirect, special, or consequential damages or lost profits arising from use
      of, or inability to use, the data or services. Nothing in this disclaimer restricts the
      rights granted to you under the CC BY 4.0 license.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
